  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">歡迎來到 Belgie 的更多村民 Forge 模組</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">這是一個適用於 Forge 的模組，它在遊戲中增添了更多的村民職業，但不會新增任何方塊或物品。所有村民職業及其交易和工作站如下所示：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">Fabric 版本請點擊此處：<span style=\"color:#000\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/belgies-mo-villagers-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊我前往 Forge 版本頁面</a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">如果您發現任何錯誤或有建議，請在此處或透過 Discord 告訴我。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">我的 Discord 連結：<span style=\"color:#000\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://discord.gg/C9jkQda\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊我加入 Discord</a></span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ACwj7RS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"1599\"><br><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:36px;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwinternode.com%252fgames%252fminecraft%252f%253fgclid%253dCjwKCAiAheacBhB8EiwAItVO22Em1PsaM1yUTYWWmg_TCijJhoyVBYg0JgGjb_142mIbUtaYrLPcpRoCkN4QAvD_BwE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Winternode 網站（點擊我）</a><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
